  "report_demo_synthetic": true,
  "metadata": {
    "purpose": "Runnable reporting request for the 2026-10-17 interface; all patients, clinicians, metrics, counts and benchmarks are fictional.",
    "compared_with_previous_example": "The original request_id, patient and clinicians structure is unchanged. scorecard_evidence is the additional report evidence block; it does not change allocation. The old local report could read an external archive; the 2026-10-17 release does not.",
    "usage": [
      "import json",
      "from pathlib import Path",
      "from reporting_interface import assign_from_request, write_agency_pdf",
      "request = json.loads(Path('examples/example_reporting_request.json').read_text(encoding='utf-8'))",
      "response = assign_from_request(request)",
      "write_agency_pdf(response, 'private-output/example_agency_report.pdf')"
    ],
    "integration_notes": [
      "Pass the complete object to reporting_interface.assign_from_request. assign_from_components does not accept scorecard_evidence; do not place the evidence inside options.",
      "For each scored RN/PT, bind scorecard_evidence.clinicians by the exact clinician_id and discipline already in clinicians. The original metric values in both locations must agree after unit conversion.",
      "All values use proportion units: 0.88 means 88%. Both the clinician metric_scale and each evidence record unit are explicit.",
      "Supply at most one benchmark per scope and metric_key in a request. scope is national, state or organization; the example supplies all ten metrics for all three scopes.",
      "Keep reporting_period, definition and applicable state_id compatible between personal records and benchmarks. Replace fictional source labels with real provenance when integrating actual data; metadata alone does not verify a source.",
      "RN Demo 1 PPH is an explicit synthetic zero, displayed as 0%. RN Demo 3 Communications is intentionally null in both locations, displayed as missing even though its benchmark exists. Never replace missing observations with zero.",
      "OT has no performance metrics or scorecard evidence because the current model assigns OT without performance scoring.",
      "report_demo_synthetic and metadata are example annotations, not new required allocation inputs. Remove the synthetic flag only when all demonstration data has been replaced with appropriately sourced real data."
    ]
  }
}
